h the 2026 environment favoring the party out of power. Polls since late September uniformly show Jackson ahead by roughly two to four points, including surveys from Republican-leaning pollsters. Expert ratings split between six tossups and four calls for Jackson, and prediction markets give him roughly a 57 to 59 percent chance.\n\nMoney is nearly even, with Collins holding a modest cash and outside-spending edge that partly offsets her incumbency disadvantage in a hostile climate. The final debate turned personal, with Jackson telling Collins to 'shut up' after a heckler derailed the event, a moment that could sway civility-minded late deciders in either direction. The race remains a genuine tossup with a slight Democratic tilt.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.7341, "margin": 3.16}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.6906, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.626, "margin": 1.5}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.6915, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.5751, "margin": 1.5}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.6364, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.6474, "margin": 2.0}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.6668, "margin": 2.0}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.6495, "margin": 2.0}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.6328, "margin": 1.5}, {"date": "2026-10-02", "p_dem": 0.6994, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-10-03", "p_dem": 0.6388, "margin": 1.5}, {"date": "2026-10-04", "p_dem": 0.6279, "margin": 1.5}, {"date": "2026-10-05", "p_dem": 0.5727, "margin": 1.5}, {"date": "2026-10-06", "p_dem": 0.6061, "margin": 2.0}, {"date": "2026-10-07", "p_dem": 0.6059, "margin": 2.0}, {"date": "2026-10-08", "p_dem": 0.6373, "margin": 2.0}, {"date": "2026-10-09", "p_dem": 0.6384, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-10-10", "p_dem": 0.6413, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-10-11", "p_dem": 0.6281, "margin": 2.2}, {"date": "2026-10-12", "p_dem": 0.7044, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-10-13", "p_dem": 0.6795, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "202